1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:02,296
What are you doing here?!

2
00:00:02,944 --> 00:00:06,314
(Raj:)Maybe Howard and Bernadette said
I could be here!

3
00:00:06,314 --> 00:00:08,244
(Stuart:)Did they?

4
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:10,950
Answer the question!
What are you doing here?!

5
00:00:12,053 --> 00:00:14,753
(Stuart:)I had nothing else
to do tonight.

6
00:00:14,756 --> 00:00:16,256
(Stuart:)The last couple of months,

7
00:00:16,258 --> 00:00:18,628
(Stuart:)I come here when I
know they're not home.

8
00:00:18,627 --> 00:00:19,657
What?!

9
00:00:19,661 --> 00:00:21,191
(Stuart:)They heard me in
the bushes once,

10
00:00:21,196 --> 00:00:23,426
(Stuart:)but they thought
it was a raccoon.

11
00:00:24,733 --> 00:00:27,233
(Bernadette:)I told you raccoons
don't say "Uh-oh."

12
00:00:30,005 --> 00:00:32,835
(Penny:)You know, one night, Leonard's
nose whistled so loud,

13
00:00:32,841 --> 00:00:36,011
(Penny:)I swear it was like
sleeping on a train track.

14
00:00:36,011 --> 00:00:37,801
(Sheldon:)Have you noticed
it's always an A-flat?

15
00:00:37,824 --> 00:00:39,314
(Bernadette:)Is it?

16
00:00:39,314 --> 00:00:40,944
Oh!

17
00:00:40,949 --> 00:00:43,349
(Penny:)It's like his sinuses
are right here in the car.

18
00:00:43,351 --> 00:00:46,521
(Sheldon:)If we're just going
to drive around aimlessly,

19
00:00:46,521 --> 00:00:48,751
(Sheldon:)the least you could do is
take me for ice cream.

20
00:00:48,757 --> 00:00:50,427
(Penny:)Yeah, I'll take you
for ice cream.

21
00:00:50,425 --> 00:00:53,055
(Sheldon:)Well, see, why can't Amy be
that subservient?

22
00:00:53,061 --> 00:00:56,901
(Sheldon:)She has coitus one time,
suddenly she's Gloria Steinem.

23
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:00,600
(Sheldon:)Anyway, I suppose an ice cream
parlor will be a good place

